5.1.3 The Executive Council shall be elected by the
vote of the members who have the right to vote in
their respective zone and shall hold office for three
years. The election of councillors shall be as follows:
(a) Year 1:
one councillor in the Moncton zone;
one councillor in the Fredericton zone;
(b) Year 2:
one councillor in the North West zone;
one councillor in the provincial zone;
one councillor in the Saint John zone;
(c) Year 3:
one councillor in the North East zone;
one councillor in the provincial zone.
Revised January 2005

